\par\par \b \uc2 Brazil's Real Strengthens Following US CPI Data  \b0\par\par\uc2 307 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 August 2006\par 15:00\par \uc2 Dow Jones Emerging Markets Report\par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO (Dow Jones)--The Brazilian real was stronger in early trade Wednesday following the release of benign U.S. inflation data.  \par \par \uc2 At 1345 GMT, the real stood at BRL2.138 to the U.S. dollar, strengthening from Tuesday's close of BRL2.140.  \par \par \uc2 Earlier in the morning, the U.S. government announced the consumer price index rose by 0.4% in July, while core prices only rose by 0.2%, which was a relief after four straight 0.3% increases. The consumer inflation outlook is restrained, indicating that the U.S. Federal Reserve may extend the current pause in its monetary tightening policy.  \par \par \uc2 That's good news for the real as rising U.S. interest rates tend to attract investment away from emerging markets such as Brazil.  \par \par \uc2 The U.S. decision canceled out the effect of news that \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  appears to be upping its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the local market following large gains by the real on Tuesday.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced Wednesday that it will sound out market demand with a view to holding a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reverse swap auction.  \par \par \uc2 The auctions allow investors to swap paper linked to \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  variation for government paper linked to interest rates. The swap allows foreign investors to enjoy Brazil's high interest rates without \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  exposure.  \par \par \uc2 If the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  detects interest in this kind of \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  during its survey later Wednesday, the bank will hold an auction on Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will also likely hold another snap auction to buy dollars on the spot market Wednesday.  \par \par \uc2 The real actually opened weaker against the dollar at BRL2.145, minutes before the U.S. data were issued.  \par \par \uc2 -By Alastair Stewart; Dow Jones Newswires; 55-11-3145 1479; alastair.stewart@dowjones.com [ 16-08-06 1300GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 1156 1843  \par \par \uc2 Dokument EM00000020060816e28g00039\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
