\par\par \b \uc2 Volatility pushes Brazil cenbank to mkt sidelines  \b0\par\par\uc2 264 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2006\par 18:50\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO, Brazil, March 8 (Reuters) - After months of entering the market almost daily to sell \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps and buy dollars to build Brazil's foreign reserves, the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has stayed on the sidelines this week to sit out volatility, traders said.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has not offered to buy dollars on the spot \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market since Monday. The bank on Wednesday will not offer to sell interest-rate linked \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps, which are designed to prevent the local real <BRBY> \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from strengthening.  \par \par \uc2 Fears of dollar outflows caused by higher U.S. interest rates have pressured emerging markets this week and the real has stumbled too.  \par \par \uc2 Now the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , instead of trying to stem the real's gains, appears to be trying to avoid adding to the choppiness.  \par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't want to increase the volatility," said Julio Cesar Vogeler, a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader at the Didier Levy brokerage in Sao Paulo.  \par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will return when it's necessary. If the real gains a lot, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will wade into the market," he added.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has not revealed its plans.  \par \par \uc2 The real has weakened nearly 3 percent this week amid fears of higher global interest rates, pulling the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  back from some of its strongest levels in five years.  \par \par \uc2 Exporters favor a weaker real and have expressed support for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  since they gained steam late last year.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 BRAZIL\b0 \highlight\uc2 -CENTRALBANK|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|D|M|RNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060308e238001ic\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
